      "content": "thanks. i've already changed my main passwords but everything feels... unnatural. like, it's not just a hack. a hacker wants my data or my money. this feels like someone is literally scrubbing my presence. i checked the timestamps on the deleted threads and they're all from the same window of time last night. it's too clean for random glitches. do you think it's possible for a high-level admin or some kind of automated system to just wipe specific user history across different platforms? it feels like a coordinated erasure.",
